// P3E.2 (essential-tips.md T1.2, X1; test-drive.md TD5.3, TD5.4): a document of 60 tabs
// (`tab-fixture 60`: small Part Studios "Studio 2" …, every fifth an Assembly, every twelfth a
// Drawing). The strip scrolls (wheel, chevrons), ▾ lists the tabs out of sight, the selected
// tab is kept in view, the Tab manager lists and filters all 60, and folders shorten the strip.
// 01 the 60 tabs: the strip starts at Studio 2; the right chevron, a fade and ▾ show there are
//    more.
// 02 the wheel over the strip: scrolled a few whole tabs (fades at both ends).
// 03 ▾: the tabs out of sight listed (a scrollbar; a separator between those before and after
//    the view; the active tab checked), the 12th hovered.
// 04 it is picked: selected and scrolled into view.
// 05 "+" → Create Part Studio: the new tab ("Part Studio 1", right of it) selected and in view.
// 06 the Tab manager: 61 tabs, its list scrolled to the end.
// 07 the Drawings filter: the 5 drawings ("5 of 61 tabs").
// 08 Clear; rows 1–12 selected (click, Shift+click) and put in a new folder, "First twelve"
//    typed into its row.
// 09 the strip after it: the folder tab first, then Studio 14 …; the manager shows the folder
//    row.
// 10 the folder opened in the tab bar: Home, "First twelve", its 12 tabs.
// 11 the last tab (Drawing 5) chosen in the Tab manager: the bar leaves the folder for the top
//    level and scrolls the tab into view; the tab cut at the left end is veiled by the fade.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("tab-fixture 60"),
        Wait(90),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-sixty-tabs"),
        Scroll(ui("tab-strip"), -4),
        Wait(15),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-wheel-scrolled"),
        Click(ui("tab-overflow")),
        WaitFor("tab-overflow-menu"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("tab-overflow-12")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("03-overflow-list"),
        Click(ui("tab-overflow-12")),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-picked-in-view"),
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("insert-tab-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("create-part-studio")),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-new-tab-in-view"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-panel"),
        Wait(10),
        Scroll(ui("tab-manager-rows"), -60),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-tab-manager-61"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-filter-drawings")),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("tab-manager-count", "5 of 61 tabs"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-drawings-filter"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-clear")),
        Wait(10),
        Scroll(ui("tab-manager-rows"), 80),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-1")),
        Wait(5),
        KeyDown("Shift"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-12")),
        KeyUp("Shift"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-new-folder")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-folder-rename-field"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("First twelve"),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-new-folder-of-twelve"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-strip-with-folder"),
        Click(ui("tab-folder-first-twelve")),
        WaitFor("tab-folder-home"),
        Wait(15),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-folder-open"),
        Scroll(ui("tab-manager-rows"), -80),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-61")),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-last-tab-in-view"),
    ],
)
